  Owner                    = {verbeek},
  Review                   = {Goal: multi-class classification
Means: visual recognition models + human annotations

Attribute-based representation of classes.
System selects attributes to be instantiated by the user, so as to maximize the information gain on the class.
The information gain is measured as the expected reduction in entropy of the class label when answering a particular question (averaging over the possible responses weighted by their likelihood). The entropy reduction is entropy of class given answers to far + visual prediction, and the entropy when the new answer is included.
A noise model on the user answers is included to tollerate incorrect instantiations.},
  Timestamp                = {2010.09.16}
