  File                     = {lan11iccv.pdf:lan11iccv.pdf:PDF},
  Review                   = {Uses 
* 9x9 SPM grid on bounding boxin each frame
* binary latent variables for each cell to switch it on or off.

graphical model has three potentials
* per-frame appearance: weights per Class, Cell and Word, only counts for cells that are "on"
* tracking potential measures: Mask similarity, Color similarity, and Box similarity between frames
* global appearance feature BoW on entire video

approximaate inference, 
* constrained by using top 100 boxes for each video frame given by Dalal-triggs HOG detector.

